26-06-19T20:16:54Z"},"body":"This uses OSC 8 escape codes, which are well-supported in modern terminal emulators.\r\n\r\nNote that macOS' own Terminal.app and conhost (the legacy Windows console) don't support named URLs, but unnamed URLs can still be used.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14992.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_print_rich_named_url.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28802932/test_print_rich_named_url.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n        print_rich(\"  Named link: [url=https://example.com]This text points to example.com[/url]. Some more text.\")\r\n        print_rich(\"Unnamed link: [url]https://example.com[/url]. Some more text.\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nDisplayed in the editor Output panel:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"523\" height=\"47\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5230b127-6c2d-4f14-bc8c-e3b4737c317b\" />\r\n\r\nDisplayed in the VS Code terminal:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"515\" height=\"50\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6ee4859-54c1-47d2-afbc-a6819789107d\" />","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120154/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120154/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}